---
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import BookingLink from '../../components/BookingLink.astro';
import DiscoveryCall from '../../components/DiscoveryCall.astro';
import { coaching } from '../../config/services.mjs';
---
<SiteLayout service="coaching" title="AI automation coaching for professionals | TJ Maynes" description="Learn to build AI automations for your work through one-to-one remote coaching. $150 USD for 60 minutes, with a focused goal, hands-on practice, and a next-step plan.">
  <main id="main">
    <section class="hero wrap" aria-labelledby="coaching-title">
      <p class="eyebrow">AI coaching for professionals</p><h1 id="coaching-title">Learn to automate the work you know best.</h1>
      <p class="lead">Bring a recurring task from your job. We’ll work through it together so you learn how to break down a problem, use AI where it helps, and check the result.</p>
      <p class="price">${coaching.price} {coaching.currency} <span>/ {coaching.minutes}-minute private session</span></p>
      <div class="actions"><BookingLink service="coaching" placement="hero" /><span class="call-note">Start with a free 15-minute call.</span></div>
      <p class="small hero-note">We’ll discuss your goal and starting point before you book paid coaching.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="section wrap split" aria-labelledby="fit-title">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Who it’s for</p><h2 id="fit-title">You understand your work. You want more ways to solve it.</h2></div>
      <div class="prose"><p>You might prepare recurring updates, organize incoming requests, move information between tools, or review material that AI could help draft or classify.</p><p>You don’t need to be a developer. We can start with visual tools and sample data. If your goal needs code, paid software, or several sessions, we’ll discuss that before starting.</p><p>Coaching gives you practice and feedback while you build. If you need someone to deliver and maintain the workflow for your business, <a href="/services/consulting/">consulting may fit better</a>.</p></div>
    </section>
    <section class="section wrap" aria-labelledby="learn-title">
      <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">What we’ll practice</p><h2 id="learn-title">A way to approach your next problem, too.</h2></div>
      <div class="example-list">
        <article><h3>Break the task into steps</h3><p>Identify inputs, decisions, outputs, and exceptions. Choose one small part worth automating and decide where AI adds value.</p></article>
        <article><h3>Build something you can inspect</h3><p>Connect tools, write a prompt, or build a small workflow. You drive while I explain, ask questions, and help when you get stuck.</p></article>
        <article><h3>Check it and change it</h3><p>Try representative examples and bad inputs. Learn to spot unreliable output, add checks, and decide when a person should review it.</p></article>
      </div><p class="section-link"><a href="/#report-demo">See an example of those checks in action <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></p>
    </section>
    <section class="section wrap split" aria-labelledby="session-title">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">The session</p><h2 id="session-title">One goal. Time to try it yourself.</h2></div>
      <ol class="steps">
        <li><h3>Set a useful goal</h3><p>Before we meet, send a short description of your task and the tools you use. I’ll help narrow it to something we can practice in an hour.</p></li>
        <li><h3>Work together on a video call</h3><p>We’ll share a screen, build in small steps, and test what changes. Use your own authorized test account or a fictional example.</p></li>
        <li><h3>Leave with a next step</h3><p>We’ll review what you can explain and repeat, then choose a small practice task. I’ll send a brief recap and a suggested next milestone.</p></li>
      </ol>
    </section>
    <section class="section wrap split" aria-labelledby="included-title">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Price and scope</p><h2 id="included-title">${coaching.price} for an hour together.</h2></div>
      <div class="prose"><p>The ${coaching.price} {coaching.currency} fee includes {coaching.minutes} minutes of one-to-one remote coaching, up to 15 minutes of preparation, and a brief recap with a practice task. Book one session at a time; there’s no subscription.</p><p>We’ll agree on the goal, tools, payment, and cancellation terms before reserving a paid session. Tool subscriptions, hosting, and AI usage are separate. An AI subscription is only needed if we agree to use one.</p><p>A session is time to learn and make progress. A production-ready automation, a repository audit, and ongoing chat support need a separate scope.</p></div>
    </section>
    <section class="section wrap split" aria-labelledby="coaching-faq-title">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Common questions</p><h2 id="coaching-faq-title">Before your first session</h2></div>
      <div class="faq">
        <details><summary>What tools will we use?</summary><p>We’ll meet by video and share your screen. The workflow may use the tools you already have, a visual automation tool, or code. I’ll confirm the setup beforehand, so you can check employer policies and any costs.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Will I get a personalized roadmap?</summary><p>We’ll choose a first milestone based on your goal and experience. If we continue, we’ll update a short roadmap using what you can build and explain independently, with practice between sessions.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Can I bring work data?</summary><p>Use fictional or sanitized examples and only material you’re authorized to share. Check your employer’s AI and data policies first. Recording or transcription is optional and requires a separate agreement; it is not part of booking consent.</p></details>
        <details><summary>How many sessions will I need?</summary><p>It depends on the task, your starting point, and practice time. We’ll decide on a useful first session and review progress before planning more. You don’t need to buy a package to begin.</p></details>
      </div>
    </section>
    <DiscoveryCall service="coaching" title="What would you like to learn to automate?" />
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
